MSX SCSI controller ROM
=======================

1983 supports compatible banked MSX SCSI cartridge firmware, including the
Z5380-based interface documented at:

  https://hackaday.io/project/205465-scsi-interface-for-msx-computers

No SCSI controller ROM is shipped or tracked in this repository. Put a ROM
you are entitled to use anywhere on the host and select it from Extensions >
MSX SCSI, or pass it with --scsi-rom. Its copyright and redistribution terms
remain those supplied by its author.

See ../SCSI.md for image preparation and boot instructions.
